Dialogue: 3,0:21:28.85,0:21:33.23,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,所以没有什么好怕的
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.85,0:21:33.23,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,何も怖くはなかった
Dialogue: 2,0:21:28.85,0:21:33.23,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\alpha&H64&}所以没有什么好怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.85,0:21:33.23,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\blur5\alpha&H64&}何も怖くはなかった
Dialogue: 3,0:21:33.98,0:21:36.48,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)\c&HFFFFFF&}很多事情想不明白
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.98,0:21:36.48,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)\c&HFFFFFF&}どうしてもどうしても
Dialogue: 3,0:21:36.48,0:21:44.36,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&HFFFFFF&}就在脑海中不停地打转
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.48,0:21:44.36,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&HFFFFFF&}分からない事ばかりが頭を巡った
Dialogue: 3,0:21:45.24,0:21:50.91,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\t(2760,3760,\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&)}你肌肤的温暖胜过一切
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.24,0:21:50.91,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\t(2760,3760,\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&)}何より温かい貴方の肌を
Dialogue: 3,0:21:50.91,0:21:54.79,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}我只是害怕失去这份温暖
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.91,0:21:54.79,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}失うのがただ怖かった
Dialogue: 3,0:21:56.42,0:22:01.50,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}就像悲伤融为一体  只求你和我
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.42,0:22:01.50,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}悲しみが溶け合う様に　私と二人
Dialogue: 3,0:22:01.96,0:22:06.13,ED-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}无论前往何方  也不要松开彼此
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.96,0:22:06.13,ED-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.7\blur1.5\3a&H64&}何処に行こうが　離さないでね
